{"id":"00294","root":"uni00294_1","name":{"ja":"ミナサキ","en":"Minasaki"},"title":{"ja":"【イタズラチョコ娘】","en":"【Mischievous Chocolate Girl】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【イタズラチョコ娘】 ミナサキ","en":"【Mischievous Chocolate Girl】 Minasaki"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-02-13","limited":true,"characterId":23,"profile":{"ja":"ヤタガラスの化身を名乗る少女。背中には黒い鳥の羽根が生えていて、一見すると堕天使のようにも見える。少し独占欲が強く、気に入ったものは自分のものにしたがる一方、自分のお気に入りを奪おうとする相手には容赦しない。気分屋で、何か必死にやっていたかと思うと、すぐに投げ出して別の事を始めていたりする。サキュバスのリリムとはいたずら仲間であり、しょっちゅうふうまにいたずらを仕掛けている困った存在。敵対心があるわけではなく、リリムと群れてふうまに構うのが楽しいようだ。２月、バレンタインの時季。街は浮かれ、店には大量のチョコが並んでいる。最初こそチョコを食べる事しか考えていなかったミナサキだが、チョコを渡すと男が喜ぶらしいと聞いて、イタズラに使えると思いつく。さっそくミナサキはパティシエの服とチョコレートを調達すると、どこかへと向うのだった。","en":"Minasaki claims to be the incarnation of a night raven. Black feathered wings sprout from her back, giving her an almost fallen-angel appearance. She has a somewhat possessive streak, eager to claim anything she likes, yet she shows no mercy to anyone who tries to snatch away her favorites. She's moody—one moment she's throwing herself into something with all her might, the next she abandons it for a new pursuit. She and the succubus Lilim are mischievous partners, constantly pulling pranks on Fuuma. There's no real hostility; they simply enjoy hanging out with Lilim and teasing Fuuma. In February, during Valentine's season, the town bustles and shops are stocked with mountains of chocolate. At first, Minasaki only cared about eating the sweets, but when she hears that giving chocolate makes men happy, she sees a prank opportunity. She quickly acquires a pastry chef's outfit and chocolate, then sets off toward an unknown destination."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"葉月まぁち","forms":[{"id":"uni00294_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1114,2228],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[111,222],"def":[128,256],"spd":[76,76],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["3","480001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009"